WEBVTT

00:34:56.121 --> 00:35:01.413
Harrison and Chewie coming into the, you
know, the Falcon and saying, you know,

00:35:01.954 --> 00:35:05.704
we're home because it just there was
something so crazy about it.

00:35:06.579 --> 00:35:10.371
And I feel super lucky to have,
you know, been part of that.

00:35:10.496 --> 00:35:14.121
I had tears in my eyes when when
Nonintuitive had their reunion.

00:35:14.871 --> 00:35:19.413
It just felt like we just couldn't
wait to show it to people

00:35:19.413 --> 00:35:21.746
because it just felt like, oh,
my God, you should see this.

00:35:21.746 --> 00:35:23.454
It's just so cool having
them back on the ship.

00:35:23.746 --> 00:35:24.913
It was a beautiful moment.

00:35:25.954 --> 00:35:29.913
I'd love to talk to you about as a Red
Sox fan, the Red Sox versus Yankees.

00:35:29.913 --> 00:35:35.829
And you have this great chapter about
just how far fans of these teams are